Z||000005||Cliff Pennock||10-09-2001||08:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever3000:<BR><B>But I have seen a LOT of the U.S. victims' stories.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Not so in Europe. The Europeans and Nato are the biggest bunch of freakin' cowards I've ever seen. I can not believe how long Nato took to activate "article 5". If it were up to me I'd go and fight at the front tomorrow. Problem is, with the stupidity the European newsmedia and governments have shown, the front has now moved to our own front doors.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000006||Cheever3000||10-09-2001||09:01 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR>...the biggest bunch of freakin' cowards I've ever seen.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE>LOL! For someone with whom English is not their language, you have a most excellent vocabulary!  I have noticed an increasing command of English in several of your recent posts, Cliff.  Have you obtained the latest translator version, or what?  No, I'm not flaming or joking, I really want to know.  You really post it well.<P><BR>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Cliff Pennock||10-09-2001||09:40 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cheever3000:<BR><B> [QUOTE]Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR>I have noticed an increasing command of English in several of your recent posts, Cliff.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Actually, I'm true bilingual - I think in both languages which sometimes makes my English a bit weird, but just as often makes my dutch weird.<P>Let's just say the madder I get, the more <FONT COLOR="blue">colorful</FONT> my language gets...<P>The thing that's p-ing me off is the fact that the European media is so darn selective with what they show. They show the sad stories of some poor Afghan sobs who got hit by (rocket-) shells (what the heck were they doing near that military base in the first place? Are they, like, suicidal? Oh wait, I guess we established that already.) which are rapidly shifting the public opinion.<P>Yesterday, they showed a documentary of a female journalist from London, showing the incredible monstrosities the Taliban is practicing in Afghanistan - public execution of women, the systematical killing of all men in villages, the raping of young girls, the torture of young men - all presented in "in-your-face" style. They aired this around <B>1 am</B>!!! Nobody I have spoken since saw this documentary. Not a single person. I'm pretty sure if they aired <B>this</B> at prime-time, people wouldn't be so quick to demonstrate in front of the American embassies.<P>For decades Europe has depended on the USA as its ally. The fact that this isn't a German forum, and that I was born at all - although I'm not a 6'5" blond Uebergott, or the fact that I don't have to stand in line to exchange food-stamps for a piece of bread, is partly thanks to the USA. And even at this moment, thousands and thousands of American soldiers are trying to keep the peace in other parts of the world besides the USA. Now for once, the USA is asking <B>our</B> support, and we are trying every excuse we can come up with to back out of it. NATO is sending <B>a single</B> warship to the middle-east. Not to actively fight this war, but just to show "we are there". Yeah right. I'm sure that'll make a big impression on the enemy.||||reg||1
Z||000008||DJRice||10-09-2001||10:33 PM||||Here's another one for you:<BR>The US dispatches its own AWACS aircraft to the middle east, so NATO can send its AWACS aircraft to the US to "help bolster homeland security."  Where's the logic?<P>To those who would whine about war and protest Operation "Enduring Freedom" I say this:<BR>Turn in the keys to your car, and your house or apartment, all of your clothes except what you are wearing and go sit your sorry arse in the desert with no food and gripe about war.<P>And to the media who would put the above mentioned whiners on TV:<BR>May your camera batteries die and the satellite uplink fail.<P>Finally...to the terrorists:<BR>If it's terror you want, it's terror you will get.  Check the business end of Americans once again fighting for freedom.  It sucks to be you.<p>[This message has been edited by DJRice (edited 10-09-2001).]||||reg||1
