Z||000018||theogre||10-10-2001||08:42 PM||||Allot of people have the verry mistaken idea that the terrorists are stupid..... What ever else they are, stupid isn't one of them. This whole thing has been planned for years. They were fully aware once they did this that the U.S. and others would come after them. I strongly believe this attack was done specifically to get this responce. They've had plenty of time to prepare for it.<P>It get's better.... The U.S. Media has been asked to carefully review their plans to air such tapes because they may have various items encoded.<P>So far I'm aware of only one network, CNN I think, that hasn't simply blown off this request.<P>Some people have said this can't be done in a live feed, wrong... Signals can be passed using the same methods durring live broadcasts. For all the Western media and governments know, the Taliban officials have been passing hidden signals in every broadcast. The most effective secret signals are the ones you can pass in plane sight.<P>You don't even have to worry that all the intended recipients see the whole thing. Even one still frame capture may be enough depending on the signal used.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
